      "instance_name": "anticipation",
      "label": "anticipatory emotion",
      "description": "The baseball player holding the ball in the catcher's mitt, poised to throw, conveys a sense of readiness and anticipation for the next action in the game, which metaphorically represents the moment of transition.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_14d0977d"
